It is evening now.
I am in my new home.
I am hungry.
I want dinner.
I like Mexican food very much.
But today I want Indian food.
So I go to the kitchen.
I open the cupboard.
Oh, the cupboard is empty.
There is nothing in the cupboard.
There is no rice there.
There are no vegetables either.
I look at another cupboard.
That is also completely empty.
I like tea.
But there is no tea there either.
I want new items today itself.
But first I want a list.
I go to my desk.
